        <div style="font-size: 16px; color: #1a2340; line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 6px;"><strong>scout</strong><button type="button" class="gloss-audio" aria-label="Play pronunciation of scout" onclick="speakGloss(event,'scout')">&#128266;</button> <span style="color: #6b7a99;">(SKOWT)</span>: A soldier who rides ahead of an army to look over the land and find the enemy.</div>
