    <div class="widget-options"><button type="button" data-choice="0">President Polk</button><button type="button" data-choice="1">General Taylor</button><button type="button" data-choice="2">Mexico’s leaders</button><button type="button" data-choice="3">Congress</button></div>
    <div class="row-feedback ph" data-ph="Right. Taylor was the general on the spot, and his army’s position set up the clash of April 25.">Right. Taylor was the general on the spot, and his army’s position set up the clash of April 25.</div>
